##[ settings.lua ]##
Allows creative players to kill mobs with only a single punch.=Giver kreative spillere mulighed for at dræbe mobs med et enkelt slag.
Prevents beds/respawn anchors from exploding in other dimensions.=Forhindrer sengene/respawn ankre i at eksplodere i andre dimensioner.
